  data: {
    LLM: 'Capture when you can; prefer taking coins/diamonds and high primiera cards (sevens, sixes, aces). Avoid leaving table cards that let the next player make a scopa.\n\nTrack which coins and high cards have been played; delay or force sweeps to deny the opponent scope; when choosing between captures, take the set that improves your primiera or coin count.\n\nSet up sweeps for yourself by leaving sums that only your hand can make; block opponent sweeps by taking key cards or playing a card that forces a non-sweep capture; in primiera, prioritise capturing aces and sixes.',
    Player: 'Capture when you can; prefer taking coins/diamonds and high primiera cards (sevens, sixes, aces). Avoid leaving table cards that let the next player make a scopa.\n\nTrack which coins and high cards have been played; delay or force sweeps to deny the opponent scope; when choosing between captures, take the set that improves your primiera or coin count.\n\nSet up sweeps for yourself by leaving sums that only your hand can make; block opponent sweeps by taking key cards or playing a card that forces a non-sweep capture; in primiera, prioritise capturing aces and sixes.',
